Grow: '1', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n          ProjectDetailsNavigator supplies six sections. AT34 is focused/scrolled disclosure content below the mounted composer. Keep unsent text, selection, scroll and owner panels stable. Back returns focus to the exact opener. Project/owner changes reset stale selection; choosing a section grants no permission and performs no read.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"YDK-0\" style={{ borderTopColor: 'var(--noir-selected)', borderTopStyle: 'solid', borderTopWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '28px', paddingTop: '20px', width: '100%' }}>\n        <div id=\"YDL-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-primary)', flexShrink: '0', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '18px', fontWeight: 500, lineHeight: '28px', width: '260px' }}>\n          04 · Motion follows evidence\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"YDM-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-secondary)', flexBasis: '0%', flexGrow: '1', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n          One 180 ms opacity/transform reveal per observed material change. No timed progress, looping live pulse or animated settled result. Stale, disconnected and unknown states rest; retain last-observed wording and source time. Reduced motion shows the same facts immediately. Announce real state changes once without moving focus.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"YDO-0\" style={{ borderTopColor: 'var(--noir-selected)', borderTopStyle: 'solid', borderTopWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '28px', paddingTop: '20px', width: '100%' }}>\n        <div id=\"YDP-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-primary)', flexShrink: '0', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '18px', fontWeight: 500, lineHeight: '28px', width: '260px' }}>\n          05 · Prove state changes\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"YDQ-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexBasis: '0%', flexDirection: 'column', flexGrow: '1', gap: '12px' }}>\n          <div id=\"YDR-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-secondary)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n            Loading has no live claim. Empty means no returned runs in this reader. Partial keeps its coverage visible. Stale retains the last observation; disconnected describes a failed read, not a stopped worker. Known completion with unreadable content offers read recovery. Unknown original effect retains the original operation and reconciliation path; never resend.\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"YDS-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-secondary)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n            Verify through the composed App: active → stale/disconnected; verified result → inspect → unsent follow-up → preview → submit; draft survives Details/Back; root and owner changes invalidate old selection; reduced motion and keyboard preserve every fact. Paper proves composition only.\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"YDT-0\" style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--noir-text-tertiary)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-ui)', fontSize: '14px', lineHeight: '20px' }}>\n            Source amendment + implementation matrix: Mastermind / docs/design/PAPER_WORKFLOW_AUDIT_2026_11_08.md · Motion reference: docs/design/prototypes/project-activity.html\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )"
